b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XshZbqstJ9-We1_EVRI_LOCATION_04_52838a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XshZbqstJ9-We1_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5283.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XshZbqstJ9-We1_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5283.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XshZbqstJ9-We1_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5283.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, placing a cardboard parcel inside waterproof packaging." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>How to pack a parcel</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Learn how to wrap a parcel for delivery with Evri to make sure that your precious cargo reaches its destination in one piece.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->It’s important to securely wrap your parcel to prevent anything moving about in transit. You want your package to arrive in the same condition you left it in.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Follow our top tips on how to wrap, pack and address your items before sending them on their way. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="why-is-it-important-to-know-how-to-wrap-a-parcel?" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0" index="2" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Why is it important to know how to wrap a parcel?</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your parcel has to go on a long journey from leaving your hands to arriving at its destination. It will:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Travel in different vehicles<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Visit more than one sorting hub<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ride several miles of conveyor belt<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be sorted by automatic scanners<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Miles will be covered. Hills will be climbed. Conveyor belts travelled. Scanners bleeped.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Don’t forget:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Your parcel needs to be wrapped well enough to stay intact should it fall off a conveyor belt (which can be up to 1.2m high).<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDW5bqstJ9-cfB_EVRI_LOCATION_04_33988a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDW5bqstJ9-cfB_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3398.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDW5bqstJ9-cfB_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3398.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDW5bqstJ9-cfB_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3398.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier checking the label on a parcel at their car before delivering" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="3" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="what-to-use-to-pack-your-parcel" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>What to use to pack your parcel</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>First, you need to consider what type of packaging or container to use to wrap your parcel. Think about the kind of item, as well as the shape and delicacy of the object you are sending to help decide how it should be packaged.

When deciding what to use to wrap your parcel, consider:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Icon of a parcel" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Box or bag</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Do you need a box, or would a mailing bag or padded envelope be better? Top tip: watertight mailing bags are best for <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-package-clothes-for-shipping" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->packaging clothes<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/310e5f30-345e-45c1-a5cb-91a5eceee8ae_What%27s+in+the+box.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Clothes in a box icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>New or old</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can buy boxes for packaging or recycle an old box from home.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/b82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Strapped boxes icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Sturdiness</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Is the box tough enough for the journey ahead? Whether the parcel is <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/small-parcel" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->small<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/large-parcel" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->large<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, the box will need to be structurally sound.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/dc53fcd3-c19c-448e-8ed2-440f14cdeee5_size_dimensions.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Icon of a tape measue" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Size</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Will the item fit inside without leaving lots of empty space? Make sure the box closes easily and retains its shape.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Followed instructions icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Labels</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you reuse a box or bag, make sure there are no old labels or barcodes showing. These might be picked up by our scanners and can send your parcel to the wrong place.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="packaging-multiple-items" class="section-wrapper" index="4" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Packaging multiple items</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re sending more than one item, please pack them securely within a single outer box. Items <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->should not be strapped, tied, or taped together, <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->as this can cause damage or items to become separated in transit.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel now" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send a parcel now<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="1.-wrap-your-items" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrypbqstJ9-WeK_EVRI_LOCATION_04_52118a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrypbqstJ9-WeK_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5211.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrypbqstJ9-WeK_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5211.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrypbqstJ9-WeK_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5211.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, holding items in one hand and is about to place them in the box in front of them." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>1. Wrap your items</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Wrap any items before you put them in the box or bag. It’s important that fragile items are carefully wrapped as our scanners can’t detect ‘fragile’ or ‘handle with care’ labels. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You could choose:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Bubble wrap<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – reuse bubble wrap you have at home to keep precious items extra safe.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Newspaper<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – use layers of newspaper sheets from yesterday’s news to fold around your items. Good for the environment and your wallet.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="2.-pack-the-empty-space" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_52398a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5239.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5239.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XsC5bqstJ9-WeQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5239.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer&#39;s hands as they are crouched on the floor, placing folded items a cardboard box." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>2. Pack the empty space</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Make sure your precious cargo stays secure by filling any gaps in the packaging around the item. This will help keep it in place and prevent it moving around.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You could use:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Paper and newspaper<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – scrunched up paper is the most environmentally friendly option, and an easy way to fill the space.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Cardboard <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->– use layers of cardboard to create a sturdy shell.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sheets<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – old, but clean bedsheets can be used to wrap items tightly.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="3.-put-your-address-inside" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc6JbqstJ9-inN_EVRI_LOCATION_05_75828a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc6JbqstJ9-inN_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7582.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc6JbqstJ9-inN_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7582.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zc6JbqstJ9-inN_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7582.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A mother is placing a pair of jeans into a parcel box with the shipping label sat beside ready to attach. Her to children are reading a book on the sofa behind her." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>3. Put your address inside</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Before you fasten the lid on your box, you need to put some details on a piece of paper inside. Include:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your own name, address and phone number<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The name and address of the parcel’s destination<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If the address label comes off your parcel during the journey, we’ll need to know where it’s headed.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="4.-fasten-your-parcel-with-tape" class="section-wrapper" index="8" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6owrpbqstJ9-cU3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_1035897b8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6owrpbqstJ9-cU3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10358.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1858%2C1239%2C4477%2C2986&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6owrpbqstJ9-cU3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10358.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1858%2C1239%2C4477%2C2986&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6owrpbqstJ9-cU3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10358.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1858%2C1239%2C4477%2C2986&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older woman is wrapping a parcel. She is applying the label to her parcel with tape." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>4. Fasten your parcel with tape</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Once your item is safely inside its box or snugly tucked inside its mailbag, secure it with tape. Make sure you: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choose strong tape<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – it’s so much more durable and secure.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Cover all openings<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – including across gaps, down the sides and underneath. Lock it down.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tape the corners<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – boost durability by taping the corners. The extra layer acts as a defence against scuffs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We cannot overstate the importance of securing the edges around your package. You should tape down:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Cardboard flaps at the top/bottom of your box.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Bits of mailbag that stick out from the main package.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Top tip<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->: Anything that sticks out – even slightly – from the package must be flattened and secured. This helps prevent it getting stuck on the belt.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="5.-label-your-package" class="section-wrapper" index="9" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xrt5bqstJ9-WeI_EVRI_LOCATION_04_51528a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xrt5bqstJ9-WeI_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5152.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xrt5bqstJ9-WeI_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5152.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xrt5bqstJ9-WeI_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5152.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer&#39;s hands placing their label on the parcel in front of them and crouching down on the floor." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>5. Label your package</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You&#39;re almost done. Knowing <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-label-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to label your package<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> is one of the most important parts of learning how to wrap a parcel for delivery. Don’t fall at the final hurdle.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->To do this, you need to:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ol><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your delivery using the Evri website or app (or you could use a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcelshops/print-in-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Print in ParcelShop device<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->) and print out your label.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> The label includes the   recipient’s name and address and your barcode.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Position the label<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> in the middle of the top of the parcel if it has flat sides. For round parcels (note: if you’re sending a poster, map etc, use a triangular – rather than circular – tube), just pop on the label where you have enough surface area.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Secure the label<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> with good-quality tape – use a small piece along each of the 4 edges. Don’t leave any paper exposed.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Write your address<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> on a return label and stick it to the back of the parcel – clearly mark it as ‘return address’ to avoid confusion.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ol><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" 